.TH CHM-OPENGL-SMOKE 1
.SH NAME
chm-opengl-smoke \- validate and preview the Chimera OpenGL graphics path
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B chm-opengl-smoke
.RI [ --self-test ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates an OpenGL context through GLFW and renders a small test scene. Without options it opens an interactive window. --self-test creates a hidden context, prints the OpenGL version and renderer, renders one frame, and exits.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success; nonzero if GLFW or an OpenGL context cannot be initialized.
